# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform. Several checks hash file bytes (the plugin's
# embedded fair-pack manifest, data/packs/eligibility-v1.json, is pinned by SHA-256 in plugin/FairPackRules.cs), and
# Git for Windows otherwise checks text out as CRLF, which broke save creation in the game ("Fair-pack manifest hash
# mismatch") and the launcher tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact fixtures: real minisign signatures over these bytes. Never converted.
installer/SoloStone.Launcher.Tests/fixtures/** -text
